{
    "title": "FoxPlay Casino: Slots & More",
    "description": "Foxwoods Resort Casino brings you the all new Casino app FoxPlay Casino. FoxPlay Casino is the newest version of FoxwoodsOnline and has a ton of exciting NEW features. In FoxPlay Casino, you can play all of your favorite casino games anytime, anywhere - all for FREE!  Download the all new FoxPlay Casino and choose from 100+ slots, video poker, blackjack, roulette, keno, bingo and much, much more. \r\n\r\nDownload to receive a FREE COIN welcome bonus and start experiencing all the fun of a Las Vegas casino in the palm of your hand!\r\n\r\nWhy FoxPlay Casino?\r\n\r\n100+ EXCITING FREE SLOTS WITH BONUS GAMES INCLUDING:\r\n\r\n-       Gaming Arts - Pi\u00f1atas Ol\u00e9\r\n-       AGS - Rakin\u2019 Bacon \r\n-       Konami - China Shores \r\n-       Lightning Box - 100x RA \r\n-       Aruze - Dancing Panda Fortune\r\n\r\nPLAY MORE 50+ FREE VIDEO POKER GAMES\r\n-       Choose from CLASSIC video poker titles like Jokers Wild, Jacks or Better, Double Double Bonus Poker, Deuces Wild and more!\r\n-       Explore popular MULTI-PLAY video poker games from Double Bonus Deuces Wild to Triple Double Bonus Poker or Jacks Or Better and play up to 25 hands at once for even bigger jackpots!\r\n-       Play over 5 varieties of Multi-Rise Video Poker, from Deuces Wild to Trio-Double Bonus Deuces Wild and Trio Joker Poker\r\n\r\nHOW ABOUT CASINO CLASSICS?\r\n-        Play Lucky Roulette, Three Hand Blackjack, Blazing Bets Blackjack or High Roller Blackjack!\r\n-        Love Bingo? Daub away up to four cards at one time! \r\n-        How about Keno? How about exciting titles like Count Dracula Keno, Lucky Cherry Keno and Leprechaun Love Keno\r\n\r\nEARN FREE COINS\r\n-        Level up to unlock more slots and earn more free coins!\r\n-        Play with friends to test your luck and earn more free coins!\r\n-        Earn Daily Bonuses and Hourly Bonuses\r\n\r\nCOMPETE IN DAILY QUESTS\r\n-        Complete daily quests to earn more coins, WIN awesome prizes or fill up your weekly progress bar\r\n-        Fill your weekly progress bar to WIN a 2X BONUS wheel spins\r\n-        New quests available every day!\r\n\r\nSPIN AND WIN IN LIVE SLOT TOURNAMENTS\r\n-        Hourly live slot tournaments take place three times a week!\r\n-        All bets during the tournament are FREE!\r\n-        Win HUGE coin bonuses in the top 3 leaderboard positions!\r\n\r\nMORE FUN and FEATURES\r\n-        Play against others in our interactive Link Lounge for even more chances to win big!\r\n-        New slots and fan favorite classic slots are featured every week! Discover something new by exploring featured video poker, blackjack, and keno games!\r\n-        Become a VIP for access to new slots as well as additional bonuses and benefits!\r\n\r\nLike FoxPlay Casino on Facebook for even  more chances at free coins\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/FoxPlayCasino   \r\n\r\nWild-Tiles and Gems Wild-Tiles are trademarks of Case Venture Management, LLC.\r\nMulti-Rise Video Poker\u2122 is a trademark of Oddworks.\r\n \r\nVisit our privacy policy here: https://foxplay.foxwoods.com/privacy-policy/\r\n\r\nView our Terms of service at: https://foxplay.foxwoods.com/terms-of-service/\r\n\r\nThis product is for players 18 years or older for entertainment purposes only. The games are intended for an adult audience. The games do not offer \"\"\"\"real money gambling\"\"\"\" or an opportunity to win real money or prizes.  Practice or success at social casino gaming does not imply future success at \"\"real money gambling\"\".  No purchase necessary.\r\n\r\nDo not sell my data: FoxPlay Casino shares your personal information with advertising partners to personalize ads. Learn more at https://foxplay.foxwoods.com/privacy-policy/. If you wish to exercise your Do Not Sell My Data rights, you can do so by contacting us via the in-game help center or by emailing support@foxplay.foxwoods.com.",
